-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Run by script through the real loader on a NextZXOS 26.11 card
              copy in default, Enhanced and with the cheat; 1.0 not yet played
              by the owner; published at his request

  Replay      32 replays in the two modes (title, play, every room by a test
              poke, the next-room path by a test poke, game over, a new game),
              58372 frames: 364184 hooks run original and build from one state
              each, every register with R and all 48K RAM; sprites against the
              game's own plots 151118 times; Layer 2 against an independent
              picture from the set's planes and backdrops on 1740 pictures; 41
              broken builds all caught.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: through the real .NEXCLASH loader from
              the tape on a private NextZXOS 26.11 card copy in default,
              Enhanced and with the cheat; output byte for byte nxc.py; 15
              emulated minutes of soak and a flicker pass on each build;
              pictures viewed. Hardware: none.

  Coverage    Scripted input, no human play: every room reached by a test
              poke, the next-room path by a test poke, title, deaths, game
              over and a new game; not reached: completing a room by play, the
              game's end.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
